{"id":"ec10595263029062","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-topo9-compact-covering-map.md","title":"Compact-Covering Map","display":"df-zfc-topo9-compact-covering-map — Compact-Covering Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo9-compact-covering-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo9-compact-covering-map"],"display":"df-zfc-topo9-compact-covering-map — Compact-Covering Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-topo10-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo9-compact-covering-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo9-compact-covering-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo9-compact-covering-map — Compact-Covering Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b77792f5f68e33d6\" href=\"?note=b77792f5f68e33d6\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-topo10-continuous-map.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-topo10-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"67cf48a2f6e27861\" href=\"?note=67cf48a2f6e27861\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-zfc-topo9-compact-covering-map-—-ZFC-Topo9-Compact-Covering-Map\">df-zfc-topo9-compact-covering-map — ZFC Topo9 Compact Covering Map</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau_X),(Y,\\tau_Y)\">\\((X,\\tau_X),(Y,\\tau_Y)\\)</span> (topological spaces), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to Y\">\\(f:X\\to Y\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,L\">\\(K,L\\)</span> (compact-subset candidates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ContinuousMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ContinuousMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9CompactCoveringMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9CompactCoveringMap}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}compact\\text{-}covering\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9CompactCoveringMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\forall K\\subseteq Y\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,Y,\\tau_Y)\\to\\exists L\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(L,X,\\tau_X)\\land f[L]=K)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}compact\\text{-}covering\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9CompactCoveringMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\forall K\\subseteq Y\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,Y,\\tau_Y)\\to\\exists L\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(L,X,\\tau_X)\\land f[L]=K)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The equality <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f[L]=K\">\\(f[L]=K\\)</span> is stronger than merely requiring a compact preimage of each point and is the defining compact-covering condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-zfc-topo9-compact-covering-map-—-ZFC-Topo9-Compact-Covering-Map","text":"df-zfc-topo9-compact-covering-map — ZFC Topo9 Compact Covering Map","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-topo10-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"b77792f5f68e33d6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-topo10-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"67cf48a2f6e27861","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\tau_X),(Y,\\tau_Y)","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"K,L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ContinuousMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9CompactCoveringMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}compact\\text{-}covering\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9CompactCoveringMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\forall K\\subseteq Y\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,Y,\\tau_Y)\\to\\exists L\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(L,X,\\tau_X)\\land f[L]=K)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"f[L]=K","display":false}],"bytes":1279,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3724","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-topo9-compact-covering-map.md|58-df-zfc-topo9-compact-covering-map]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","b77792f5f68e33d6"